\newlabel{fig:grid_kmeans_maps}{{15}{24}{Grid K-means partition at $q_c = 0.52$ (time-and-session-averaged normalised speed). Each colour represents one cluster. Clusters are labelled congested (hatched) if their mean $\bar {r}_k < 0.52$; since all time-averaged cluster speeds exceed 0.52, no hatching appears --- the threshold captures only acute per-timestep drops below free-flow}{figure.caption.33}{}}
